{"1358780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SKAZ: Shadow of the Tsar", "steam_appid": 1358780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKAZ: Shadow of the Tsar</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AS LONG AS YOU’RE REMEMBERED — YOU LIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An isometric action-RPG where memory is your weapon, fate is currency, and a shattered Slavic world breathes with forgotten gods.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken without a name.<br>Without a past.<br>In a world torn into four realms — <strong>Yav, Nav, Prav, and Vid</strong> — where every memory can reshape you… or destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world recognizes you.<br>Then instantly forgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must <strong>remember</strong> who you were…<br>or choose who you will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/extras/a9aa472b5d430ee41061d839995ca30c.poster.avif?t=1764701923\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/extras/a9aa472b5d430ee41061d839995ca30c.webm?t=1764701923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY THIS GAME IS DIFFERENT</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No classes. No limits. You rebuild your identity.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every memory fragment you recover:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlocks new abilities and combat styles,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >reshapes your personality and morality,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >alters NPC relationships,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >opens hidden paths and outcomes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >changes how the world reacts to you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t follow a story.<br>You <strong>reconstruct your soul</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/extras/2ebe6355ae98274759b0b0741621916c.avif?t=1764701923\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat driven by will, ritual, and forgotten power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nav-born monsters,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shadows of ancient gods,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cursed volkhs,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creatures erased even from folklore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Slavic rites, protective symbols, curses, and abilities tied to what you choose to <strong>remember</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/extras/b17b57133f3542131a4b3f61b5a5aa70.avif?t=1764701923\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four realms. Four laws. One broken world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yav</strong> — the mortal world, collapsing under its own weight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nav</strong> — land of the dead, where whispers drown screams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prav</strong> — forsaken domain of gods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vid</strong> — reality of reflections and stolen memories</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These aren’t just locations.<br>They are <strong>four versions of reality</strong>, woven into a living system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/extras/03a1ef162ba2e90882ca5986505ff9d0.avif?t=1764701923\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slavic noir carved in shadow and myth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fog-drenched forests, ancient idols, drowned villages, ghost-lit marshes.<br>This is not a fairy tale.<br>This is <strong>SKAZ</strong> — a world trying to forget you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/extras/c0ad6cc61e30c83b63e1b8f705718888.avif?t=1764701923\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECLAIM YOUR NAME.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RECLAIM YOUR FATE.<br>AS LONG AS YOU’RE REMEMBERED — YOU LIVE.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKAZ: Shadow of the Tsar</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AS LONG AS YOU’RE REMEMBERED — YOU LIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An isometric action-RPG where memory is your weapon, fate is currency, and a shattered Slavic world breathes with forgotten gods.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken without a name.<br>Without a past.<br>In a world torn into four realms — <strong>Yav, Nav, Prav, and Vid</strong> — where every memory can reshape you… or destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world recognizes you.<br>Then instantly forgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must <strong>remember</strong> who you were…<br>or choose who you will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/extras/a9aa472b5d430ee41061d839995ca30c.poster.avif?t=1764701923\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st