strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four realms. Four laws. One broken world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yav</strong> — the mortal world, collapsing under its own weight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nav</strong> — land of the dead, where whispers drown screams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prav</strong> — forsaken domain of gods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vid</strong> — reality of reflections and stolen memories</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These aren’t just locations.<br>They are <strong>four versions of reality</strong>, woven into a living system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/extras/03a1ef162ba2e90882ca5986505ff9d0.avif?t=1764701923\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slavic noir carved in shadow and myth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fog-drenched forests, ancient idols, drowned villages, ghost-lit marshes.<br>This is not a fairy tale.<br>This is <strong>SKAZ</strong> — a world trying to forget you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358780/extras/c0ad6cc61e30c83b63e1b8f705718888.avif?t=1764701923\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECLAIM YOUR NAME.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RECLAIM YOUR FATE.<br>AS LONG AS YOU’RE REMEMBERED — YOU LIVE.</p>", "short_description": "An isometric action-RPG where memory is your weapon and four fractured realms shape your fate. Wake without a name — and survive. As long as you’re remembered, you live.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Polish, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": 